{"1632060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Terminal Earth", "steam_appid": 1632060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Pitch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terminal Earth is a solo sci-fi survival extraction shooter where a lone survivor undertakes increasingly dangerous missions on an alien-harvested Earth, guided by a moon-based rebellion, in a world that actively tries to kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632060/extras/7621938dd088112535562c93554e54ee.poster.avif?t=1770540969\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632060/extras/7621938dd088112535562c93554e54ee.webm?t=1770540969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632060/extras/7621938dd088112535562c93554e54ee.mp4?t=1770540969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player extractor shooter with roguelike progression</strong><br>Risk everything on each run — extract safely to keep your loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, tactical top-down combat</strong><br>Dash, jump, reposition, and survive against overwhelming threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated missions</strong><br>Every deployment offers new layouts, objectives, enemy combinations, and unexpected danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four mission types with escalating stakes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge resources for the resistance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy alien installat